Retained V3 attempt3 remains a failure with7 unexpected activated processes, although final host cleanup removed every exact owned PID/runtime. The bus activation chain is directly recorded in retained-privateBus.log: actual peerA PID615203 requested org.freedesktop.portal.Desktop; Desktop requested PermissionStore/Documents/portalGTK and portalHyprland; portalGTK requested GVFS. SourceGTK4.22.4 gdksettings-wayland.c invokes should_use_portal for Settings during display startup. gdk.c checks activatable portal availability and calls its property interface; private session bus inherits installed service activation definitions. This explains autoload in a plain QA app without a portal user action. Exact commands of all7 processes were not recorded; do not invent missing names.

